      "url": "http://go/v1/AfX2wtRGbuzUawpg_AEHP39pKTfjmQ6K7SxCX12-gopQvKcXeW-wWzP0zrnvCPDosz8IBbEkbLFgyzxVK-buDf4thm8WAhwOAsuDHKXFCvTGyxZcoSi2sbJBwb_FSlEz8FB38i_PRfNCUYwj8IW7iDZD3wK-zLWstUOfQeSjem1l5a8XCCyyHL6U87jt_gY",
      "snippet": "The architecture of MOSS-VL-Realtime is specifically designed for long-context streaming video understanding. Core components include: Decoupled Cross-Attention: Decouples cross-attention computation between video feature extraction and text generation, significantly reducing end-to-end throughput and latency overhead on high-frequency frames. Absolute Timestamps: Encodes absolute time info for each frame of the input video sequence, allowing the model to perceive physical flow, independent of fixed FPS or relative position."
